OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, arrested after car
OL,4,Acrashes at bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of taking a motor vehicle
OL,8,Fwithout the owner's consent following a
OL,9,Fcollision on a bridge.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police said it
OL,12,Freceived a report of a single-vehicle
OL,13,Fcrash at the bridge over the River Ise
OL,14,Fbetween Kettering and Warkton on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FThe force said it happened on Pipe Lane
OL,18,Fshortly before 05:30 BST.
OL,20,FThe boy has been released on police
OL,21,Fbail pending further inquiries and the
OL,22,Froad had reopened, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
